<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Deployment on 我的空间</title><link>https://chenjinxin.cn/tags/deployment/</link><description>Recent content in Deployment on 我的空间</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 12:06:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://chenjinxin.cn/tags/deployment/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>CKAD 常用资源：Deployment</title><link>https://chenjinxin.cn/p/ckad-%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90deployment/</link><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 12:06:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://chenjinxin.cn/p/ckad-%E5%B8%B8%E7%94%A8%E8%B5%84%E6%BA%90deployment/</guid><description>&lt;p>&lt;code>Deployment&lt;/code> 用来管理无状态应用副本和滚动更新。CKAD 常考创建 Deployment、修改镜像、扩缩容、回滚、暴露 Service。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="yaml-模板">YAML 模板&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt"> 1
